        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Moon Valley"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:a715d0b0dfdc62c5",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2f7994dfd5aa7f0558ac5ec1208c2035d690f6f0d362acf18bbe2f7fd321fe3c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to Uyuni airport for the flight to La Paz. On arrival, you are met and transferred to the 4★ Mitru hotel or a comparable property. There is time to check in and rest before the sightseeing tour."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:339153bde11dd7cb",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c64d2e98db0fd62d89dc40a6746883e01f896d2c6c7886a9f26a28104e7291b7",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "The tour starts in the historic centre of La Paz. You visit its main squares and architectural landmarks and learn about the city's history and the daily lives of its residents.\n\nVendors at the Witches’ Market sell medicinal herbs, amulets, ritual objects and handicrafts. These objects reflect Andean beliefs that live on in Bolivia today.\n\nNext, you head to Moon Valley on the outskirts of La Paz. Erosion has carved clay spires, narrow ravines and rock formations here. Light and shadow accentuate the shapes that gave the valley its name."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:31614c3dab8525d0",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "cc4027787220cdd8b0b369fe34a173d24d6997f1283df41d3cae3581dd355d39",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Return to the hotel for some time at leisure. Overnight at the 4★ Mitru hotel or a comparable property."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:dcbf317d699403a3",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2776a3339bb012b47108232ba5918c7bc45dbbc535c65c4d1194ac36162cf0d0",
      "provenance": {
