        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-20261107-2qs2lbapgi9",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Panoramic view of La Paz and a snow-covered mountain on the horizon, Bolivia"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_hover:c385a702ec10ce4b",
